  "release": {
    "tag": "toolchains-2026.08.8",
    "title": "Move toolchains 2026.08.8",
    "notes": "Adds the first patched Move GCC package: native Windows GCC 16.2.0 move.1 for x86_64 UCRT64, built from move-engine/gcc commit ced2ae7f6670c0371e0464e5aaa888c44ebd012a. It fixes the imported-namespace reflection/module compiler crash and is qualified after extraction to a path containing spaces with an isolated PE runtime audit, C++26 reflection smoke test, and the exact Nez imported-namespace module probe. The archive preserves GCC's configured install/ basename beneath a versioned outer directory so its sysroot remains relocatable. The two clang-p2996 0ac75f2f Windows and Ubuntu 22.04/glibc 2.35 artifacts are retained byte-for-byte from immutable release 2026.08.7."
  },
